了。","spans":[{"text":"我知道她的选择只是出于当时的立场，只是看到她自怨自艾的样子总是让人来气，所以我也懒得去看她了。"}]}],"next":"24carnival_lind#11"},"24carnival_lind#11":{"id":"24carnival_lind#11","act":11,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"name":null,"rawName":"bravo","isProfessor":true,"professorVariant":"bravo","lookup":"bravo"},"units":[{"uid":"24carnival_lind#11","rawText":"但我想，至少现在的帕斯卡已经有所改变了。","displayText":"但我想，至少现在的帕斯卡已经有所改变了。","spans":[{"text":"但我想，至少现在的帕斯卡已经有所改变了。"}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":156,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"alpha":1,"isDark":true}]},"next":"24carnival_lind#12"},"24carnival_lind#12":{"id":"24carnival_lind#12","act":12,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":1056,"name":"琳德","rawName":"琳德","isProfessor":false,"lookup":"린드"},"units":[{"uid":"24carnival_lind#12","rawText":"是吗？那听起来是件好事，不过我还是不掺和了。","displayText":"是吗？那听起来是件好事，不过我还是不掺和了。","spans":[{"text":"是吗？那听起来是件好事，不过我还是不掺和了。"}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":156,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"alpha":1,"isDark":false}]},"next":"24carnival_lind#13"},"24carnival_lind#13":{"id":"24carnival_lind#13","act":13,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":1056,"name":"琳德","rawName":"琳德","isProfessor":false,"lookup":"린드"},"units":[{"uid":"24carnival_lind#13","rawText":"唔诶……讲了好多正经的话……好难受……教授，再给我一颗糖。","displayText":"唔诶……讲了好多正经的话……好难受……教授，再给我一颗糖。","spans":[{"text":"唔诶……讲了好多正经的话……好难受……教授，再给我一颗糖。"}]}],"next":"24carnival_lind#14"},"24carnival_lind#14":{"id":"24carnival_lind#14","act":14,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"name":null,"rawName":"bravo","isProfessor":true,"professorVariant":"bravo","lookup":"bravo"},"units":[{"uid":"24carnival_lind#14","rawText":"唉，好吧。时间还早，琳德，那我们讨论一下你第一次来报到结果因为低血糖晕倒在我的指挥部面前的事情？","displayText":"唉，好吧。时间还早，琳德，那我们讨论一下你第一次来报到结果因为低血糖晕倒在我的指挥部面前的事情？","spans":[{"text":"唉，好吧。时间还早，琳德，那我们讨论一下你第一次来报到结果因为低血糖晕倒在我的指挥部面前的事情？"}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":156,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"alpha":1,"isDark":true}]},"next":"24carnival_lind#15"},"24carnival_lind#15":{"id":"24carnival_lind#15","act":15,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":1056,"name":